cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this pattern, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "agent-governance-loop"
abstract: >-
  A deployable governance pattern for AI agents on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore.
  Cedar policy at the Gateway decides each tool call. Bedrock Guardrails in
  policy screen what a tool returns. Decisions are recorded in CloudWatch, and
  withheld responses in a CloudTrail trail. An evidence pack is read from the live account to show what was enforced.
authors:
